+  })
+})

NOTES
- The production change is concrete and dependency-free.
- The test hunk intentionally needs adapting to the repo's existing test helper names before upstream submission.
- This follows the direction already discussed by GOV.UK maintainers in issue #6966: Intl.Segmenter for human-expected character counting.
